# Weber June — OAuth client credentials
#
# These are the app-embedded OAuth client credentials from the Weber Connect APK
# (com.weber.config.WalkerProdConfig). They are the same for every install and
# recoverable from the public APK; they are NOT a per-user secret. They are kept
# out of the repository, so you must supply them via the environment of the
# process running Home Assistant.
#
# Extract them from a Weber Connect APK, then set in HA's environment:
#   - Container / Supervised: pass -e WEBER_CLIENT_ID=... -e WEBER_CLIENT_SECRET=...
#   - Core (venv/systemd):    Environment= lines in the unit, or `export` before `hass`
#   - HAOS:                    env into the core process is not user-serviceable;
#                              see the README for the /config file fallback.

WEBER_CLIENT_ID=
WEBER_CLIENT_SECRET=
